==English==
[[File:Chapa All your base are belong to us.jpg|thumb|Button bearing the text "All your base are belong to us."]]

===Etymology===
Mistranslation of {{der|en|ja|[[君]][[達]]の[[基地]]は、[[全て]]CATSが[[頂く|いただいた]]|lit=we (CATS) have taken all of your bases}}.  This grammatically incorrect "[[Engrish]]" phrase originated in the English subtitles of the 1991 European {{w|Sega Mega Drive}} version of the 1989 Japanese arcade game ''{{w|Zero Wing}}'' and became a [[catchphrase]]/[[meme]] on the Internet in the early 2000s.

